 Pricing | Lumail.io Skip to content Lumail Product Agents Pricing Docs Changelog English ▼ Log in Sign up Pricing You pay for emails sent. Never for subscribers stored. Type how many emails you send a month. We pick the cheapest plan and the bill for that volume. Emails you send each month Type a number or drag the slider. 1K 5K 20K 40K 100K 400K 1M Best match Creator $20 /month for 40K emails Free $0 /month Everything working end to end, for nothing. Start free 3,000 emails/month included No overage. The send simply stops 2 team members 10 AI credits/month 3 sending domains 1 web domain Unlimited workflows Agent, API, CLI and SDK access Creator For this volume $20 /month For a list that pays for itself. Start with Creator 40,000 emails/month included Then $7 / 10,000 10 team members 100 AI conversations/month 10 sending domains 1 web domain Unlimited workflows Bring your own ChatGPT or Claude subscription Pro $60 /month More volume, more seats, a lower rate per email. Start with Pro 100,000 emails/month included Then $5 / 10,000 25 team members 300 AI conversations/month 50 sending domains 3 web domains Unlimited workflows Bring your own ChatGPT or Claude subscription Business $200 /month High volume, more seats, lower rate per email. Start with Business 400,000 emails/month included Then $4 / 10,000 100 team members 1,000 AI conversations/month 1,000 sending domains 5 web domains Unlimited workflows Bring your own ChatGPT or Claude subscription Transactional and marketing email share the same quota. No card for the free plan. Questions about pricing Do you charge per subscriber? + No. There is no subscriber limit on any plan, and no line on your invoice for list size. Import 50,000 contacts on day one if you want. The price only moves when you send. So what will it actually cost me? + The first 3,000 emails each month are free, no card required. Creator is $20/month with 40,000 emails included. A 20,000-contact list emailed four times a month is 80,000 emails, costing $48. Use the calculator for your volume. How is this different from Mailchimp, Kit, or Beehiiv? + Some competitors now expose MCP too, so compare the real workflow instead of the AI label. Lumail&#x27;s full catalog has 139 organization-scoped tools across campaigns, workflows, subscribers, analytics, and transactional email, with a visual app, CLI, SDK, and API beside them. The billing model is the other difference: Lumail prices emails delivered and stores unlimited subscribers, so a dormant record does not raise your bill. Can Lumail send my app&#x27;s transactional emails too? + Yes, and that&#x27;s the point. Point your app at our SMTP relay (smtp.lumail.io:587, STARTTLS) or the API and your password resets, receipts, and OTPs ship from the same place as your newsletter. They travel in a separate instant lane, so a 50,000-recipient campaign can never make a login code wait. Do I need to be a developer to use Lumail? + No. Everything runs from the dashboard: a visual workflow builder, a filter builder for segments, and an AI-assisted editor. The API and SDK are there when you want them, not a prerequisite. Can my AI agent run my newsletter? + If you already work in Claude Code, Cursor, or another MCP client, add your API token and 139 organization-aware tools show up. Ask for a campaign, a segment, or last month&#x27;s numbers and the agent does it. Entirely optional. The dashboard does the same job. Compare plans in detail Free Creator Pro Business Core Subscribers Stored contacts are never billed. You pay for emails sent. Unlimited Included emails Emails included in base subscription price (not charged for overage) 40,000 Overage pricing Price per extra 10,000 emails after the included volume. $7 / 10,000 Email domains Sending domains you can authenticate. 10 Web domains Custom domains for capture pages and hosted content. 1 Workflows Automation graphs you can publish. Unlimited Team members Maximum number of organization members 10 Sending Monthly email